We present this excellent 3-bedroom apartment in Lamaçães, Braga, located in one of the city's most sought-after areas. The property stands out for its excellent location, spacious rooms, abundant natural light, privacy and open views, including views towards Bom Jesus and Sameiro from the bedroom area.

The apartment has been renovated, providing greater comfort and functionality.

The renovation included:

 - A completely new kitchen;

 - New laminate flooring;

 - Refurbishment and painting of the woodwork;

 - Altered doors, including doors with glass;

 - Renovated bathrooms with new sanitary fixtures and furniture;

 - New walk-in shower base.

The apartment offers generous living areas and plenty of natural light.

The living room and kitchen have access to a balcony, while the master bedroom with en-suite bathroom also has its own balcony.

Two bedrooms have built-in wardrobes. The third, centrally located bedroom currently has no built-in wardrobe and can be used as a young person's bedroom, office or work/study room. There is also the possibility of installing an additional built-in wardrobe if required.

The kitchen offers excellent storage space and is equipped with:

 - Ceramic hob;

 - Oven;

 - Microwave;

 - Extractor hood;

 - Boiler for hot water and central heating radiators.

 - The property also includes a private garage for one car, with access directly at street level and no access ramps, making it particularly convenient.

Lamaçães is one of the most sought-after areas of Braga, with supermarkets, bakeries, banks, schools and a wide range of services nearby, as well as leisure areas and a cycle path.

The location also provides easy access to Braga city centre and the motorway.

An excellent opportunity for those looking for a renovated 3-bedroom apartment with spacious rooms, plenty of natural light, balconies, a private garage and a prime location in Braga.

